  "title": "Brown Sugar Cream Cheese Frosting",
  "description": "This is an alternative to the classic recipe that calls for powdered sugar. My husband and I use it to frost fruit cocktail cake. Try it on applesauce cake, spice cake, banana cake, or carrot cake, too.",
  "authors": [
    "Anne Brothers and Rick Smetzer"
